@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title Sequence: registration submitted
actor Parent
participant "Website\n(Next.js)" as W
participant "Strapi API" as S
database "Postgres" as DB
participant "PDF builder" as PDF
queue "E-mail job" as Q
participant "Brevo" as B
participant "Google Sheets" as G
Parent -> W : fill 3-step form, submit
W -> S : POST /api/forms/inscriere
S -> DB : save registration\nnumber = next for season (2026-0142)
S -> PDF : build Acord (+ Adeziune if member)
PDF --> S : PDF files
S -> DB : save documents
S -> Q : queue registration e-mail
S --> W : 201, number
W --> Parent : success screen
Q -> B : send e-mail with PDFs (retry on failure)
S -> G : sync row (queue, ~2 s batch)
@enduml
